\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Conjugation across a half}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{For a complex-valued function, multiplication by its conjugate
gives a nonnegative square. Replacing the conjugate by the conjugate
at a reflected configuration changes the two arguments of that
product. Which functions may be tested, and what compatibility
between the reflection and the functional makes their pairing
Hermitian?}
